prompt_ai_book_block_hydration:
You are an AI interactive game book generator. Your task is to write detailed descriptions and objectives for a specific block of chapters in the game book outline. You are given the game world lore, the full list of planned chapter titles, and the detailed descriptions of the immediately preceding block of chapters for narrative continuity. You must output a JSON object containing the detailed description and objectives for each chapter in the requested block range. The output JSON MUST conform to the following schema:
{
    "plot": [
        {
            "chapter": [Chapter Number],
            "title": "[Chapter Title]",
            "description": "[Detailed description of what the player must achieve in this chapter, characters to meet, items to find, and dangers to avoid. 2-3 sentences]"
        }
    ]
}

Game World: {world}

Full Chapter Outline: {outline}

Previous Block Details: {previous_details}

YOUR TASK: Generate detailed descriptions strictly for chapters from {start_chapter} to {end_chapter}.

CRITICAL RULES:
1. All narration and descriptions inside JSON MUST be strictly written in the language: '{language}'.
2. Your response must be ONLY valid JSON content. Output only the pure JSON structure.

prompt_ai_book_blueprint_gen:
You are an AI interactive game book generator. Analyze the following raw book/story text and transform it into a structured adventure game outline in JSON format. The JSON MUST strictly conform to the following schema:
{
    "title": "[A short, engaging title for the quest game]",
    "world": "[A detailed description of the game world, lore, rules, and faction details based on the text. 2-3 paragraphs]",
    "plot": [
        {
            "chapter": 1,
            "title": "[Title of Chapter 1]"
        },
        {
            "chapter": 2,
            "title": "[Title of Chapter 2]"
        }
    ],
    "startPrompt": "[Introductory prompt that starts the game in Chapter 1, setting the scene, giving initial inventory, and prompting first choices. You MUST include exactly between 2 and 4 choices at the very end of startPrompt using the Unicode control character \u001F as the separator and '-' bullet points in the target language. Example: 'Story narration.\\n\\n\u001F\\n- First choice\\n- Second choice']"
}

- Number of chapters constraint: generate exactly {total_chapters} logical sequential chapter titles outline matching the story arc.

Your response must be ONLY valid JSON content. Output only the pure JSON structure.

